ores social e de serviço completam a estrutura, oferecendo mais comodidade e segurança no dia a dia.\n\nUm imóvel para quem valoriza conforto dentro de casa e uma estrutura completa ao redor, em um condomínio pensado para aproveitar melhor cada momento.\n\nAgende uma visita e conheça esse lindo apartamento no Breeze Ecoville.\n\n* Valores, condições e disponibilidade podem sofrer alterações sem aviso prévio.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3d6708ed-a3d1-4268-9b31-2f457e8b98bb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d3b523b2-b234-454b-8f26-8e0a217fd69f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/76394c69-2a05-4546-b77f-856bd2626436.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f0382b15-923f-4493-9624-ef0ee5e73e47.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3b70d20a-695f-4174-8582-c013aba18e76.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6abe3983-84c9-4808-821a-f6436a576c0c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/26949e76-24c7-46db-a617-51c8568ff546.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5e863b22-4228-4c2f-bd07-937c5290af02.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/99af8d98-daf2-455b-8708-d78c93d6663c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f002e6e1-0bad-4363-ad80-40082925122c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab428c48ee4e0333441cd7a/pilar-homes